      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work a pick-up round along the lower bodice edge, placing one dc into each dc or ch space evenly around the full circumference. Join into a round and work dc downward for 45 cm, adding one dc every 10 sts on every fifth round for a gentle flare. Fasten off."
          }
        ]
      },
